    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk if it's even medical. it just feels... deeper than that. like i saw something over there that made everything here feel fake. everyone is so obsessed with trivial stuff, like their jobs or what they're eating, and it just feels so empty. i don't feel like i belong in this shallow world anymore. it's like i'm on a different frequency and there's no way to tune back in.",
